{"id":"n71480-4-7","stage":1,"title":"튼튼하다 · 坚定","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71480-4-7-1","ko":"사람들이 질서를 잘 지키네요.","zh":"大家真守秩序啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"질서를","meaning":"秩序","explanation":"질서：秩序；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"질서","audio":"/audio/5c921269f86ce84f722e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62100","senseId":"1","lemma":"질서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질서를","audio":"/audio/8acd1f014847d980ad40.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"지키네요.","meaning":"遵守","explanation":"지키다：遵守；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"지키다","audio":"/audio/43f3170b8d3dc6fa99c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29754","senseId":"4","lemma":"지키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지키네요","audio":"/audio/d13a49f5cb01266a619a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5c921269f86ce84f","term":"질서","zh":"秩序","audio":"/audio/5c921269f86ce84f722e.mp3","entryId":"62100","definition":"在众人聚集的地方，为了避免出现混乱而遵守的次序。","pronunciation":["질써"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"43f3170b8d3dc6fa","term":"지키다","zh":"遵守","audio":"/audio/43f3170b8d3dc6fa99c2.mp3","entryId":"29754","definition":"不违反约定、法律、礼仪、规定等而严格遵照。","pronunciation":["지키다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ad48d4c75f41e6439a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71480-4-7-2","ko":"튼튼한 시민 의식들이 있어서죠.","zh":"因为大家都有很强的公民意识吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"튼튼한","meaning":"坚定，牢固","explanation":"튼튼하다：坚定，牢固；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"튼튼하다","audio":"/audio/646fa517b1e63fe66868.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71480","senseId":"4","lemma":"튼튼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"튼튼한","audio":"/audio/8ea6c7936d4502ddc4ba.mp3"}},{"text":"시민","meaning":"公民","explanation":"시민：公民。","readings":[{"term":"시민","audio":"/audio/95ee67336fa520b5988c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71099","senseId":"2","lemma":"시민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시민","audio":"/audio/95ee67336fa520b5988c.mp3"}},{"text":"의식들이","meaning":"意识","explanation":"의식：意识；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"의식","audio":"/audio/2a45b0dd02cce2315c70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24080","senseId":"2","lemma":"의식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의식들이","audio":"/audio/633e7946ad559c5cdd5f.mp3"}},{"text":"있어서죠.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어서죠","audio":"/audio/67a516e537b65e8ec1ca.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"646fa517b1e63fe6","term":"튼튼하다","zh":"坚定，牢固","audio":"/audio/646fa517b1e63fe66868.mp3","entryId":"71480","definition":"思想或精神等非常稳定，达到了不可动摇的程度。","pronunciation":["튼튼하다"]},{"id":"95ee67336fa520b5","term":"시민","zh":"公民","audio":"/audio/95ee67336fa520b5988c.mp3","entryId":"71099","definition":"一个国家的国民，拥有该国法定权利和义务的人。"